[{"id":"990601519002214401","date":1525012781000,"rawContent":"For the #MeToo Movement, I am going to also include, #MySistersKeeper! That is very important.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990628322332893186","date":1525019171000,"rawContent":"Dear CAMILLE COSBY, know that you are a JEWEL! I'm sorry that your garden became a space of toxicity. #MeToo! #MySistersKeeper! Yet, you have persevered with elegance and grace. https:\/\/t.co\/YybstBhl7o","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/Db9rLaGWsAUH6EC?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990629788510576642","date":1525019521000,"rawContent":"There is a Spiritual aura, I am feeling from Andrea Constand. Her Spirit is not of this time. She is going to teach the #MeToo! Movement and women a lesson. I feel her presence is not being showcased enough. Why is that? Her presence and Spirit is important in this case.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990672747977199618","date":1525029763000,"rawContent":"So, for Andrea Constand. . .I am not going to discuss her stance on the case. I have a different perspective for that. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990690756754116615","date":1525034057000,"rawContent":"So, one comment had a rather unflattering picture of her, questioning as to why Bill Cosby would have to drug a woman who (according to his opinion) looked unattractive. #MeToo  #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990691607467917314","date":1525034260000,"rawContent":"The issue that people don't understand is that \"beauty,\" doesn't equate to keeping a man's interest OR \"taking a man from a woman,\" or a man pursuing a man. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990691952365580288","date":1525034342000,"rawContent":"Being \"unattractive,\" doesn't mean that a woman can't be drugged OR that she can't seduce a man. However it happened. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990692568215244800","date":1525034489000,"rawContent":"Correction: \"a man pursuing a woman.\" #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990693052678275072","date":1525034604000,"rawContent":"I do find it interesting that the other women are taking the limelight, when it was Andrea Constand's case got the conviction. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990693368769458177","date":1525034679000,"rawContent":"Correction: that got the conviction. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLives