62695168","date":1525035751000,"rawContent":"And honestly, some of these accusers, I feel (because they were inside of a married man's house and wanted Camille's place) are angry that their racial privilege didn't lead to breaking up a marriage so that they could be \"Mrs. Cosby.\" #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990698771930583041","date":1525035968000,"rawContent":"Or that being with Bill, didn't get them the fame and status that they hoped for in being so close to a powerful man. There are women exploiting #MeToo. Let's be #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990699224491806720","date":1525036076000,"rawContent":"But, I also feel other women are getting more of the limelight than Andrea Constand, whose case actually got the conviction. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990700537220911104","date":1525036389000,"rawContent":"Andrea Constand has a particular ancient feminine aura, about her. I don't want to give all my thoughts at this time. Yet, I feel she was slipped in somehow was a testament to what may or may not happen to Dr. Bill Cosby. #MeToo #My SistersKeeper.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":17.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990700961533440000","date":1525036490000,"rawContent":"Her presence is going to shatter our traditional understanding of womanhood, the Feminine, and how women are to treat other women. That's all I'll say on that, for now. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":18.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":18.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990726478819221504","date":1525042574000,"rawContent":"Ladies, allow positive women to be your best protector. Nourish healthy relationships with strong, healthy, independent, intelligent women. Support women businesses, mentor young women, and build strong support systems with healthy-centered women. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":19.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990727107851509763","date":1525042723000,"rawContent":"Sexual violence against women, and men, is linked to that. When someone feels that they have you in their power, because you see them as the only opportunity, you become exploited. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":20.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990727980644171776","date":1525042932000,"rawContent":"When healthy, empowered, sharing women, support other healthy, empowered, sharing women, there is more protection and security for women. I believe that, Dearly. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":21,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":21.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990731241640079360","date":1525043709000,"rawContent":"And of course, loving, creative, good-Spirited WOMEN and MEN, need to support each other. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":22.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":22,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":22.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"990982912916054016","date":1525103712000,"rawContent":"Dear #MeToo, when are we going to start telling the truth about those wicked women, who a