sMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":31.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":31,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":31.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991275593298739200","date":1525173493000,"rawContent":"Or when\/if he pursued them, (though sexual harassment laws were not strong or prevalent during that time), file a report against him, alert his wife in some way, connect to whatever women's rights groups that were around, and bring persistence. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":32.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":32,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":32.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991275953446948865","date":1525173578000,"rawContent":"Dr. Cosby, cheating on your wife, and drugging women is a crime. You have to pay for that. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":33.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":33,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":33.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991276863816454144","date":1525173796000,"rawContent":"So Ladies, let this trial be a LESSON, but in a different way. Seeking male power, raping another Sister's garden, does not lead to happiness, true wealth, or power. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":34.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":34,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":34.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991277390998528001","date":1525173921000,"rawContent":"Healthy-Spirited, loving, abundant, generous Women, are our best bet, in achieving success, and the joys we seek. And they can be found in gardens. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":35.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":35,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":35.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991278519115280384","date":1525174190000,"rawContent":"That's how I met mine. And, later I will discuss that. But in the future. And Mexican maidens, of their gardens, in combination with healthy, Egyptian feminine energy, made that possible. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":36.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":36,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":36.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991288333216215042","date":1525176530000,"rawContent":"Because Ladies, you don't get protection from the Feminine, when you didn't seek her, and participated in hurting her, trying to destroy her, so you can use men to betray another woman, for your own, sick, and psychotic validation. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":37.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":37,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":37.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991290044311797761","date":1525176938000,"rawContent":"And the fact that those particular Cosby accusers, at the courthouse, feel the \"real victory,\" is getting Bill Cosby convicted, and not seeking Camille Cosby, re-planting\/helping to re-heal that they participated in destroying states that there is #MeToo. #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":38.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":38,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":38.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991290242710859776","date":1525176985000,"rawContent":"something wrong in the culture of womanhood. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper!","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":39.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":39,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":39.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991291582983831552","date":1525177305000,"rawContent":"And, I want to address the racial privilege, connected to this whole issue. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":40.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":40,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":40.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991293239998255104","date":1525177700000,"rawContent":"Honestly, I get a sense that a lot of these women (who happened to be White American) want to use this case, as a payback for Cosby not replacing Camille, for them, or them getting the wealth, status, that they desired from White privilege, as women. . .#MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":41.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":41,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":41.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991293642420752384","date":1525177796000,"rawContent":"regardless of their gender. I feel many of them are disgruntled that Bill Cosby didn't leave Camille, so that they could be \"Mrs. Cosby.\" #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":42.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":42,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":42.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991294086664609792","date":1525177902000,"rawContent":"In their minds (as I have experienced in my coupling, here in Cairo), Dr. Bill Cosby, should have been with a White woman. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":43.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":43,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":43.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991294855342063616","date":1525178085000,"rawContent":"They thought, that since they are White, that it would be \"easy,\" to take a Black man from a Black woman (or semi-looking Black woman, in Camille's case). I, myself have experienced such, here in Cairo. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":44.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":44,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":44.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991295196179652608","date":1525178166000,"rawContent":"And in Black American her\/history, many of our Mothers and Maidens, have had to deal with this invasion, and abuse of our cultural gardens. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":45.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":45,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":45.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991295701949743104","date":1525178287000,"rawContent":"These women were not shocked, bothered, or indifferent that Bill Cosby would abuse his own wife and children, through infidelity. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper They didn't care.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":46.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":46,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":46.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991296209364160512","date":1525178408000,"rawContent":"What they became shocked about, or got a wake-up call, is that is that if a man abuses and mistreats the women of his own culture, he'll do it to you, as well. White skin color, or non-Black status won't save you from this. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":47.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":47,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":47.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991297360033611776","date":1525178682000,"rawContent":"So, after such women participated in infidelity WITH him, against his wife and children (emotional &amp; psychological violence), they were then violated and drugged. It was shocking because they thought that he would treat them with respect and dignity. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":48.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":48,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":48.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991299131787370496","date":1525179105000,"rawContent":"There was a psychological sickness in their mentality, that by him initially cheating with them, against his wife, they had \"defeated,\" Camille. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":49.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":49,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":49.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991299825026109440","date":1525179270000,"rawContent":"And the \"Black-looking,\" woman at the trial is not Black American. She is Cuban (a Latina) married to a Black American man. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper You have people, who only want to claim our culture (and look) when it is convenient. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":50.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":50,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":50.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991300964580671489","date":1525179542000,"rawContent":"And I just saw an article on the New York Times Arts and Culture, talking about the #MeToo movement, including Women, Jazz artists speaking against sexism. #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":51.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":51,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":51.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991301607513083904","date":1525179695000,"rawContent":"Well, JAZZ, is a Black American art form, so why are not Black American maidens mainly gracing the cover? So, let's start with that. And Black American maidens being disrespected, and mistreated in our own art form. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":52.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":52,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":52.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991306218038812673","date":1525180794000,"rawContent":"Because too many non-Black women, who can't get validation in their own communities, come into Black American gardens, disregard the feminine presence of our culture, gloat in psychotism, when dating Black American men. Feeling they are \"superior,\" to our #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":53.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":53,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":53.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991306528610283521","date":1525180868000,"rawContent":"Mothers and Maidens, and come in with a \"I'm replacing you, attitude.\" #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":54.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":54.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"991306989669056514","date":1525180978000,"rawContent":"There are a lot of emotions, and feelings I am trying to convey about this trial. #MeToo #MySistersKeeper","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":55.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":55.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"996432667137794048","date":1526403035000,"rawContent":"#MeToo requires being #MySistersKeeper!  Disrespecting, and mistreating other women, for male appeasement is wrong.","media":null,"username":"studyabroaddiva","contain